{"title":"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/4/7c43070a2acf8f4e25d98e48c404d9348a26d40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/9/09920c3af0daa12ac2ec5174e737c31e0f8cec75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{B}$\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" /> are nonzero digits, then the number of digits (not necessarily different) in the sum of the three whole numbers is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/a/09af7496b4ffdb27348f275b8ab9b58041caf217.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{tabular}[t]{cccc} 9 &amp; 8 &amp; 7 &amp; 6 \\\\ &amp; A &amp; 3 &amp; 2 \\\\ &amp; &amp; B &amp; 1 \\\\ \\hline  \\end{tabular}\\]\" width=\"121\" height=\"58\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/7/8a738a7b8f5ad3cd4a96a218175001cfff196cb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 4 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 5 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 6 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 9 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\text{depends on the values of A and B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"567\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The smallest possible sum occurs if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/c/34cc0ee4399c5595afef4d0992fb46828805584f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=B=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"85\" height=\"13\" />, so it is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/6/2a69ee94384d5d8ac98b2d014d30c2b8d51e611c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9876+132+11=10019$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"198\" height=\"15\" />.  The largest possible sum occurs if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/e/e6eadb8c2e1d33fc5192b97bf7f9559e9f9e8fa0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=B=9$\" width=\"85\" height=\"13\" />, so it is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/a/2babe35892debeaec562bff3318f7704d0e7dfdd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9876+932+91=10899$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"198\" height=\"15\" />.  Therefore, the sum is between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/b/95b0dbaf29c2e88daa079c79b22c69ec867d5a1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10019$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3311cc0fb9a9b63de6923425b4be606caa2ad72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10899$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" />, so it has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/a/66a140486a6900048ea83c3db3adc932efad6f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"54\" height=\"28\" /> digits.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME\" title=\"1987 AJHSME\">1987 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1987\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" titl